{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "ac232641c08f9790d9c03ef13a01680a1eb29b91c780c7c65342a683164696a5", "ja": "姫を目指してお勉強！なのです", "zh": "为了成为公主而努力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3035f4d08bf864a22c7b5de8805286c9a557018ab20f34730e2943da363dfcb7", "ja": "素敵なお姫様ユニットになるため、まつりが\n企画した『お姫様講座』。第1回講師は真と\n雪歩。少女漫画の話で盛り上がったりお茶を\n飲んだりしながら、まつりとエミリーは\n『相手を理解すること』の大事さを学んだ。", "zh": "为了成为迷人的公主团体，茉莉规划了\n『公主讲座』，而第一堂的讲师是真和雪步。\n大家一边喝茶，一边热烈讨论著少女漫画，\n茉莉和艾蜜莉从中学习到了\n『理解对方』的重要性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e855fb1c2f0382a8f03acfa01c089283f8ff8aa70214ff3fa771911a390e6fd", "ja": "（レッスンに先立って、まつりから呼び出された。\nやりたいことがあるらしいけど、何だろう……？）", "zh": "（在训练课程开始之前，茉莉找我过去。\n她似乎有某个计划，会是什么呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "2f66f21c786b24a39ca8dc9e1b0a5bc56b9670ebc475ee1d81c811d93b9998e4", "ja": "よく来てくれたのです。\nエミリーちゃん、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "你们都到了呀，\n小艾蜜莉、{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "f04bcd982607b25c478ca1ec88207f982cc747bdd611fd0a40f039e6bfd724cc", "ja": "今日からふたりには、\n『お姫様講座』を受けてもらうのです！", "zh": "从今天开始，\n你们两位要参加『公主讲座』的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "135b6dc6b6dce3a39b457edfbc6c1169c41003880e7b75744d2372aab04e8251", "ja": "ふたり……え、俺も？", "zh": "两位……咦？我也要？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "6f03b1792fa3de862861f09eb790994c8d2810932b43adecea0773eaa7905fd9", "ja": "お、お姫様講座……ですか？\nそれはいったい、どのようなものなのでしょう。", "zh": "公、公主讲座……？\n那究竟是什么样的讲座呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "8a82a62aa8f8f2382174a892b9ccf726d9f771cfde61cb081688dcdd47063084", "ja": "姫とエミリーちゃんが、とびきり・きゅーと！な\nお姫様ユニットになるための、特別講座なのです。", "zh": "是为了让公主和小艾蜜莉成为特别可爱的公主团体，\n而举办的特别讲座的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "ea149d021653655a58ad6d379ea17997e1206517aa1e09a5219666acbeb0eb11", "ja": "この講座を受けるだけで、わんだほー！？\n素敵なお姫様ユニットになれてしまうのです～。", "zh": "光是参加讲座就能成为\n美妙又迷人的公主团体的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "56ea43cbd55122123a2ba44f845175fc0888cc21d8024a5a1e6b4246cec2d768", "ja": "その上、今なら受講費用がかかりません！\nとってもお得なカリキュラムなのですよ！", "zh": "而且现在不收学费！\n是物超所值的课程的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e5825453abe628e145e8347653f0076b265d8f1e68e2f0578a4dd175bffba125", "ja": "なんだかすごく怪しい気もするけど……。\nどうだ、受けてみるか？　エミリー。", "zh": "总觉得超级可疑……\n不过艾蜜莉，要不要听听看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "c574eddf20a0ae13596951ca393b523987f6fbba9aea0391ea98d135c3138eaa", "ja": "……仕掛け人さまが、そう仰るならば。\nまつりさん、よろしくお願いいたします！", "zh": "……既然策划执行人先生这么说，\n茉莉，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "b1c700a482843ffacce0c16cc8abb26b741946900774552ad5a6a8ea2cbde679", "ja": "では、記念すべき第1回、開講なのです。\n特別講師のおふたり、どうぞー！なのです！", "zh": "那么，值得纪念的第一堂课要开始了喔。\n两位特别讲师，请上台的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "f377f579257e5aa784ebdc63c371b61706f3326541123fed6c1f53e4342fcabd", "ja": "どうも！　特別講師の菊地真です！\nお姫様といえば、やっぱりボクだよね♪", "zh": "大家好！在下是特别讲师菊地真！\n说到公主，当然一定要找在下啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "45801d9ea189fbdfb785f07c7dedf8edb9bfbb5b6d175576f143bb6c80bd1bbd", "ja": "は、萩原雪歩です……。お姫様って、お姫様だよね？\n私に教えられることが、あるのかなぁ……？", "zh": "我、我是萩原雪步……公主就是那个公主没错吧？\n我有什么可以传授的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "974e23e2c94877ec5346df6ff291ebdfb120f4cd1bc88d404a8ec61e96515a46", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、雪歩。自信を持とう！　せっかく\nまつりとエミリーが、ボク達を頼ってくれたんだから。", "zh": "没问题的，雪步，要有自信！\n难得茉莉和艾蜜莉都来拜托我们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "570fed4834081e74280dd71f0ed47988b332e1da779ca90b4e402ac6a6c453c0", "ja": "う、うん、そうだよね。私に、お姫様の何が\n教えられるかわからないけど……がんばるね！", "zh": "对、对喔，的确是呢。虽然我不知道自己\n能传授什么关于公主的事……但我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "41186d7b9c15bb2fd781210679c1b47ccbeece9be02d9b9a73685d88ea52e506", "ja": "まぁ、真さまと雪歩さんに、お姫様の心得を教えて\nいただけるんですか？　帳面を用意しなければ……。", "zh": "哇，能从真小姐和雪步身上学习公主的要领吗？\n我得准备笔记才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f005e0cf841dbe87436d049653b48af8325ed6fd486158d64fdd21926c5aae57", "ja": "うん、なかなかためになりそうな講座だな。\n真、雪歩、よろしく！", "zh": "嗯，感觉会是相当有意义的讲座呢。\n真、雪步，拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "07373d4307b4def1c83facfa20eb5e9bde4443d7b81d6022d1862335846da757", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\nボクに任せてください！", "zh": "是，{$P$}，\n请交给在下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "de8363f66a11495447ed93f67145724724b7718a26b41fb5118eac4220cb3aab", "ja": "さっそくですけど、今日は資料を持ってきてて……。\nじゃ～ん！　これだよっ♪", "zh": "事不宜迟，我们今天带了资料过来……\n锵锵～！就是这个♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ed59525b056622f3842f36084e64faa5f9a215ef6e2085e2facb5429cd90ea61", "ja": "これは……少女漫画雑誌の『りるきゃん』じゃないか。\n真、これが資料なのか？", "zh": "这……不是少女漫画杂志《莉露甜心》吗？\n真，这就是你准备的资料吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "7b1c426ac5b0c96c0f251ad1f14d20ec8f64a1d4a5bf5dc4436cb95de4ad2cc7", "ja": "そう、夢見るオトメのバイブル、りるきゃんです！\n切ない恋の物語や、カッコいいヒロインの話……。", "zh": "没错，就是怀梦少女的宝典《莉露甜心》！\n里面有着虐心的爱情故事、帅气女主角的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "ab36d6f1a41d2765b746d909cb96d7df172bfd11c38789bf517c14fae7d3a94c", "ja": "ボクがお姫様について言いたいことは、だいたい\n全部、この雑誌につまってるんだ！　読んでみて！", "zh": "关于公主，在下想说的几乎都\n汇集在这本杂志里了！读读看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "ede888bf5fa933c7f73c681f64fbf90215787f38903c88fde6f1bd90e85c1154", "ja": "なるほど、りるきゃん……！\n帳面につけておかなくてはですね。", "zh": "原来如此，《莉露甜心》……！\n要写在笔记上才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "00df8eda2bbb3f02d17d61f15b2fec43e6a6a0dc4d7a18f632c8eeedf976cd4f", "ja": "真ちゃん、さすがなのです。\n姫もりるきゃんは、創刊号から全て持っているのです。", "zh": "不愧是小真的呀。\n从创刊号开始的每本《莉露甜心》，公主也都有买喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "d85d838cfeb6cca3225c14eff413901007948b29c7d5fca57895e9aa5ca70b8a", "ja": "本当に！？　さすが、漫画好きなだけあるね！\nそういえばこの前、可憐たちがモデルやってたよね？", "zh": "真的吗！？不愧是漫画迷！\n这么说来，之前可怜她们有当过杂志模特儿对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "d047d1fb99b2763b2d2bdca5489e40ea01396ee5e4145be402e73b963872e582", "ja": "そうなのです！　りるきゃんのイメージモデル……\n姫、とってもとっても、うらやましかったのです～。", "zh": "没错的喔！《莉露甜心》的形象模特儿……\n公主超级超级羡慕的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "293813f3a49c10c3270ed90dd538f35964812ec15d8c578348f0c9a2fa3b3129", "ja": "ボクもボクも！　りるきゃんのモデルなんていいな、\nうらやましいな！　ボクもやってみたかったな～……。", "zh": "在下也是！能当《莉露甜心》的模特儿真好，\n好羡慕喔！在下也好想当当看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "d6e075bac96e17c3b5cb1eda57d7c3e2dd7e1eae90c908871fde30a8ca4e06b0", "ja": "そうだ、まつり！　最新号は読んだ？", "zh": "对了，茉莉！你看过最新一期了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "80a46204da14eebca3dc6a4726cc6dfa0b5bef09a3bbd11e4b03522e04579321", "ja": "当然なのです。新連載の『ブレイブリープリンセス』が\nすごく面白かったのです～。", "zh": "当然的喔，新连载《勇敢公主》\n非常有趣的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "19e854946eaecf35d92572713cd65419c9b6f77e0a59b3bc0f67e4e134197c32", "ja": "そうそう、主人公のお姫様がカワイイのに強くて！\nそれと、つけペン子先生の新作だけど……。", "zh": "没错，当主角的公主可爱却又很强悍！\n还有沾水笔子老师的新作品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "5df517731ef62cdd516641d5eef086f4140c521aab90f659f39df9dd2a19e3ec", "ja": "せ、専門用語が……\nええと、新連載の『勇敢なる姫君』と……？", "zh": "都、都是专业术语……\n那个，新连载《勇敢公主》和……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "afaab9c110259cde6188437fcaa5a26a25cb2280fa6a4fd861defd93d8e46d2a", "ja": "それじゃ、私は今のうちに……。", "zh": "那我就趁现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c5c66c3d4dc45f5801dc7448bfa14e2e1b40fe57e70471fa7caa06aeccc2292f", "ja": "あれ？　雪歩、どこに行くんだ？", "zh": "咦？雪步，你要去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d6bf77409a136191fec9221f7b8e87ec12d3d52b54cae2578a8eb20ef1173c16", "ja": "えっと、話が長くなりそうだから、お茶でも淹れて\nこようかと……おいしいお茶っぱ、持ってきたんです。", "zh": "因为大家似乎会聊很久，我打算去泡个茶……\n我带了很顺口的茶叶过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "8d9fcadddfd03e48af41696ce26bfded0a47977c9c60b383d7494034912cc0a3", "ja": "それなら、私もご一緒します！\nいいお抹茶を持ってきているので……。", "zh": "那我也一起去！\n我也带了不错的抹茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "f6ca0142370c6de9c63a410d5bc12a5ab1ddc552247f197a893c405299b918dd", "ja": "っぷは～！　ごちそうさま、雪歩、エミリー！\nすっごくおいしいお茶だね。", "zh": "呼哇～！雪步、艾蜜莉，谢谢招待！\n这茶真好喝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1036_021mat", "source_sha256": "bad7d5e9207a21bce5bd4952976e6c9383e0242acbe743e6637cc5aa969e90b2", "ja": "熱すぎず温すぎず、ちょうどいい温度なのです。\nさすが、雪歩ちゃんとエミリーちゃんなのです。", "zh": "不会太热也不凉，温度恰到好处的喔。\n真不愧是小雪步和小艾蜜莉的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4721b0b36da6224f7606e630468ed8505d9bdbcef20fff70792dbca1ad7dc062", "ja": "よかったぁ、えへへ……♪\nおかわりが必要だったら言ってね、ふたりとも。", "zh": "太好了，嘿嘿……♪\n两位如果要续杯就说一声吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "b381c51dd98b69b59fb4010f70d3c6b018387b9d398f068661f181a45dcda414", "ja": "えっと、講座はもういいのか？　なんだかみんなで\n漫画の話をして、お茶を飲んでただけのような……。", "zh": "那个，不开讲座了吗？\n总觉得大家只是边喝茶边聊漫画而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "0c34df1df4955a24120b2ae5a4bb9d161b905bf6ba3ebf235b6c06520ac855a2", "ja": "それでいいのですよ、{$P$}さん。\nとっても、お姫様らしいのです♪", "zh": "就是这样才好的呀，{$P$}先生。\n这很有公主的感觉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "0fdfb8bcf107d8824b088f54615bf7afb4a45aecf691ed7410c513aed229f008", "ja": "そ、そうか……エミリーは、何かないのか？\nふたりに、聞きたい事とか……。", "zh": "是、是吗……艾蜜莉有想说些什么吗？\n有没有问题要问她们两位……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "ea7e487cd4b2109c614f9bac66962c5f051480918ef9dad5cdbe096134460a19", "ja": "聞きたいこと……あっ、あります！\n以前から、ずっと気になっていたのですが……。", "zh": "问题……啊，有的！\n我从以前就一直很好奇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "e49ec38d49fa3c267a6f9265f42bf8c63e0228442cf8035d6a40d52800ec252f", "ja": "真さまと雪歩さんは、とっても仲良しですよね？\n仲良くされるには、何か秘訣があるのでしょうか？", "zh": "真小姐和雪步感情很好对不对？\n感情要变得这么好，有什么秘诀吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "6b4dabdbcb6975428d00743aa3ffb268238f2ebe6cdc7a337f01679abb510eb7", "ja": "仲良しの秘訣、かぁ……うーん。あえて言うなら、\nボクが雪歩と仲良くしたいから……かな？", "zh": "感情好的秘诀啊……嗯，硬要说的话，\n就是在下想和雪步增进感情……这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "e7ea8f68e5f5baf35da50518bc753071335578beddcb2d97476b800ad7201027", "ja": "仲良くしたいから……ですか？", "zh": "想要增进感情……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1045_006mak", "source_sha256": "eec92d7403a65c30f5cfc422f50fe75026f3bf06c857def72f1285e1db296bf8", "ja": "うん。雪歩って、見た目はかわいくて優しそうで、\n実際その通りなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，雪步看起来可爱又温柔，\n实际上也是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1046_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "ab704ff2528d7d14b081b907afbd7046f7dbb9591dad504046067b50a196663c", "ja": "でもすごく芯が強いっていうか、がんばりやなところが\nあって……そういうの、尊敬してるっていうか。", "zh": "但内心又十分坚定，或是说很努力……\n在下很尊敬她这些地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "57b87c6809ab0d896806d7faa78167a8cf8322706b414b96ff9c44ac4db69d76", "ja": "わ、私なんか全然、そんなことないよ！？\n優しいのもがんばりやなのも、真ちゃんの方だよ……！", "zh": "我、我才没有这么好！？\n温柔又努力的是小真才对……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c82f432a0b04a6c0b34dff75a3e14161528f2d54f4eb188173615bb5192616ed", "ja": "真ちゃんは、見た目はカッコよくて、しかも優しくて。\n今日みたいに、いつも後輩のみんなのことを考えてて。", "zh": "小真的外表很帅气，而且个性温柔体贴，\n就像今天一样，总是为后辈着想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1050_004yuk", "source_sha256": "58a83c585289df6de3df12587b9afa2741077faa507f14f06e0e84c86b6336f7", "ja": "私も、真ちゃんみたいに……劇場のみんなの、\nいい先輩になれたらなって……。", "zh": "我也希望能像小真一样……\n成为剧场伙伴们的可靠前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "de8552f88587ab33431be92a7b46a41f7e21d133a3d56b53f291ff00a80e8fde", "ja": "そんなこと……今だって雪歩は、\nみんなにお茶を淹れてきてくれたじゃないか。", "zh": "什么呀……\n雪步你刚刚不是也替大家泡了茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1052_006mak", "source_sha256": "b36d4ef434c40489bc008168a52fbdab7ac0ccb94398757e18e96ad631df7532", "ja": "そういうさりげない気遣いができるところ、\nボクは見習いたいなって思うよ！", "zh": "在下很想多多学习\n你这种自然而然的体贴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1053_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ac2f6f68703c2f6c36a4566c916f18ebad8d388c569ef2e6456626199e616e8", "ja": "真ちゃん……。", "zh": "小真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1054_021mat", "source_sha256": "c106fc339eede4fdaf54c12179e88ee4ca1ab9cd696d925cb4986a407cc69a8d", "ja": "ふたりは、お互いをりすぺくとしているのですね。\nぴーすほー！な関係なのです。", "zh": "两位都很尊敬彼此呢，\n是很和平的关系喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "625c3c595d5ce2704cc359458463f03301f43ab3e57180dd95287db31ab418ba", "ja": "はい。とても素敵です……！", "zh": "没错，非常美好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1056_p", "source_sha256": "e278da0590311bf8e7ae2c59cc44431680a99ea70f025ce3e03f8da4eec3aba7", "ja": "つまり、真も雪歩もいい先輩だってことかな。\nこれからも、頼りにしてるよ。", "zh": "也就是说，真和雪步都是很可靠的前辈，\n以后也要拜托你们啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1057_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f848d6b661a071d7d4c0af96c4973fe073969452fe60083537e13fef35a38c40", "ja": "{$P$}……えへへ。\nはい、私なんかにできることなら……！", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n好的，如果我帮得上忙的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1058_006mak", "source_sha256": "793ea4ffd0e93af5cfbfa7df43b067379ec4c21dcd428d3a455d641d154e6ddc", "ja": "任せてください！　これからも、バリバリ\nお姫様アドバイスしていきますからね！　へへっ♪", "zh": "交给在下吧！\n在下以后也会大力传授公主建议的！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1059_032emi", "source_sha256": "8296ac4f8ced9f91e22f5781b8a16d823333ef62022410a663ea0d6544b3c195", "ja": "まつりさん……私たちも、\nおふたりのようになれるでしょうか？", "zh": "茉莉……\n我们也能变得跟她们两位一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1060_021mat", "source_sha256": "e6fceac0b45838084b0e79fcbc06c75b3d84815388045ec4f0125e775fbefe67", "ja": "きっとなれるのです。そのためにも……\nたくさんお喋りして、お茶を飲むのですー！", "zh": "一定可以的，为了这个目标……\n我们要多多聊天、一起喝茶的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1061_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_02_1062_p", "source_sha256": "3c990e990ca242cb9dd4469b3abeaee18ee504b7a3bbebd42accb938e2d0ab79", "ja": "（真と雪歩の関係性から、学び取れるものがあった……\n『お姫様講座』、意外に奥が深いかもしれないぞ！）", "zh": "（真和雪步的关系当中，有值得学习的部分……\n『公主讲座』也许比我想的更有深度喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
